{
  "declaredLength": 2792,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n在這裡見到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳還真巧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A5728901988E1898B523000100003110000FF01014F6059B39084771F5DE73002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下來我有場交易，\n歡迎<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳參觀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B4F866211670958344EA46613FF0C000A6B618FCE00100003110000FF01014F6059B353C389C03002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "久等了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E457B494E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼廢話不多說，\n我們就開始吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC5EE28A714E0D591A8AAAFF0C000A621150115C31958B59CB5427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "異次元密阿雷的調查費用，\n闊星公司負擔的部分不會太少嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75706B2151435BC6963F96F776848ABF67E58CBB7528FF0C000A95CA661F516C53F88CA064D4768490E852064E0D6703592A5C1155CEFF1F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是一開始就決定好的金額，\n我們也提供了器材等等設備。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F4E00958B59CB5C316C7A5B9A597D768491D1984DFF0C000A621150114E5F63D04F9B4E86566867507B497B498A2D50993002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "同時器材的開發也需要費用。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540C6642566867507684958B767C4E5F970089818CBB75283002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那些事我們非常明白。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但是，調查對象眾多，\n出動的人員比預料來得多。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E9B4E8B62115011975E5E38660E767D300200100001BE01000A4F46662FFF0C8ABF67E55C0D8C61773E591AFF0C000A51FA52D576844EBA54E16BD4981065994F865F97591A300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人工作了，是會累壞的。\n慰勞的方法之一不正是錢嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA5DE54F5C4E86FF0C662F67037D2F58DE76843002000A617052DE768465B96CD54E4B4E004E0D6B63662F932255CEFF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但現在要變更金額的話，\n要拿到預算許可也需要花時間。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4673FE572889818B8A66F491D1984D76848A71FF0C000A898162FF523098107B978A3153EF4E5F9700898182B1664295933002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這一點我們也很明白。\n畢竟貴公司是擔任都市開發的大企業嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E009EDE621150114E5F5F88660E767D3002000A75627ADF8CB4516C53F8662F64D44EFB90FD5E02958B767C768459274F01696D561B300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但你應該也很明白，\n為了都市開發，調查有多麼重要。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464F6061C98A724E5F5F88660E767DFF0C000A70BA4E8690FD5E02958B767CFF0C8ABF67E56709591A9EBC91CD8981300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們都是為了這座城市在行動，\n但現在再談下去只是沒完沒了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501190FD662F70BA4E8690195EA757CE5E025728884C52D5FF0C000A4F4673FE5728518D8AC74E0B53BB53EA662F6C925B8C6C924E86300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……既然如此，\n用寶可夢對戰來決定如何呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202665E2713659826B64FF0C000A75285BF653EF59225C0D62304F866C7A5B9A59824F555462FF1F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒有問題。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請讓我選擇<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n來做這場比試的合作夥伴。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C926709554F984C300200100001BE01000A8ACB8B936211907864C70010000201000000000A4F86505A901958346BD48A66768454084F5C59254F343002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在是在談生意。\n不能讓烏羽等候。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE5728662F57288AC7751F610F3002000A4E0D80FD8B9370CF7FBD7B4950193002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這也是為了展現我的骨氣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E5F662F70BA4E865C5573FE621176849AA86C233002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了和馬斯卡托決定出是誰輸誰贏，\n也只能打寶可夢對戰啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E86548C99AC65AF536162586C7A5B9A51FA662F8AB08F388AB08D0FFF0C000A4E5F53EA80FD62535BF653EF59225C0D62305566FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這也是為了烏羽先生的面子，\n我要全力擊退兩位。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E5F662F70BA4E8670CF7FBD5148751F768497625B50FF0C000A621189815168529B64CA900051694F4D300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趕快打一打吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D955FEB62534E0062535427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "盡說些漂亮話而已，\n是沒辦法打動人心的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76E18AAA4E9B6F024EAE8A71800C5DF2FF0C000A662F6C928FA66CD5625352D54EBA5FC37684FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們鏽蝕組，對於讓人們願意\n來工作這點可也是感到自豪的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501193FD87557D44FF0C5C0D65BC8B934EBA50119858610F000A4F865DE54F5C90199EDE53EF4E5F662F611F523081EA8C6A7684300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟事關烏羽先生的面子，\n我可是一點也不會放水的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF4E8B95DC70CF7FBD5148751F768497625B50FF0C000A621153EF662F4E009EDE4E5F4E0D6703653E6C347684300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別讓烏羽他們等了，\n趕快開始寶可夢對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52258B9370CF7FBD4ED650117B494E86FF0C000A8D955FEB958B59CB5BF653EF59225C0D623054273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蜈蚣王！跟你一起的話，\n就算是這種局面也能笑著度過！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "870886A3738BFF018DDF4F604E008D7776848A71FF0C000A5C317B97662F90197A2E5C4097624E5F80FD7B1184575EA6904EFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級進化所產生的連結……\n就讓你們見識一下盔甲鳥的美吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A9032531662407522751F768490237D5020262026000A5C318B934F605011898B8B584E004E0B76D475329CE576847F8E5427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老翁龍和我是一心同體！\n就讓你們瞧瞧超級進化真正的力量吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80017FC19F8D548C6211662F4E005FC3540C9AD4FF01000A5C318B934F60501177A777A78D857D1A90325316771F6B637684529B91CF54273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甘拜下風。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果不是和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>並肩作戰的話，\n輸的會是我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751862DC4E0B98A8300200100001BE01000A5982679C4E0D662F548C00100002010000004E2680A94F5C623076848A71FF0C000A8F3876846703662F62113002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "輸了就是輸了！\n調查費用就先不動吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F384E865C31662F8F384E86FF01000A8ABF67E58CBB75285C3151484E0D52D55427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也會飯少吃一點，\n來為鏽蝕組貢獻的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F670398EF5C1154034E009EDEFF0C000A4F8670BA93FD87557D448CA2737B7684300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個調查動員了整個鏽蝕組，\n我會盡快讓預算通過的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B8ABF67E552D554E14E866574500B93FD87557D44FF0C000A6211670376E15FEB8B9398107B97901A904E76843002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們組裡的那群人，\n暫時由我自己出錢來慰勞他們吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150117D4488E1768490A37FA44EBAFF0C000A66AB66427531621181EA5DF151FA93224F86617052DE4ED650115427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n特別獎勵也不會忘了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A72795225734E52F54E5F4E0D67035FD84E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B37684FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n另一種顏色的烏羽裝扮西裝組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53E64E007A2E984F8272768470CF7FBD88DD626E897F88DD7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說在美髮沙龍能\n照著我的髮型做。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA57287F8E9AEE6C999F8D80FD000A71678457621176849AEE578B505A300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "馬斯卡托，\n要是讓密阿雷變成更棒的城市，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大家就會聚集過來花錢了吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "99AC65AF53616258FF0C000A8981662F8B935BC6963F96F78B8A621066F468D2768457CE5E02FF0C00100001BE00000A59275BB65C316703805A96C6904E4F8682B193224E865427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你說得沒錯。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為此我也希望能和鏽蝕組\n維持比現在更加良好的關係。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608AAA5F976C92932F300200100001BE01000A70BA6B6462114E5F5E0C671B80FD548C93FD87557D44000A7DAD63016BD473FE572866F452A0826F597D768495DC4FC23002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從小生長的城市就算變了，\n我的人生都刻劃在這裡，所以我很喜歡。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E5C0F751F9577768457CE5E025C317B978B8A4E86FF0C000A621176844EBA751F90FD523B52835728901988E1FF0C62404EE562115F88559C6B61300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一切都是為了感謝這座城市\n接納了過去曾是小混混的我們。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00520790FD662F70BA4E86611F8B1D90195EA757CE5E02000A63A57D0D4E86904E53BB66FE662F5C0F6DF76DF7768462115011300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烏羽有他的信念的話，\n我也擁有自己的信念。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70CF7FBD67094ED676844FE15FF576848A71FF0C000A62114E5F64C1670981EA5DF176844FE15FF53002001000020114000E0000",
